title GOST 19.701-90 Terminator Shape Demonstration

rectangle "Current @startgost Implementation" as current {
  (START) --> [Process Data] --> (END)
  note bottom: Currently uses circles\n(Activity diagram style)
}

rectangle "Proper GOST 19.701-90 Standard" as proper {
  component "START" as start #lightgreen
  rectangle "Process Data" as process
  component "END" as end #lightcoral
  
  start --> process
  process --> end
  
  note bottom: Should use stadium/oval shapes\n(Rectangles with rounded ends)
}

note as legend
**GOST 19.701-90 Algorithm Flowchart Standards:**
• START/END: Stadium/oval shapes (not circles)
• PROCESS: Rectangles 
• DECISION: Diamonds
• INPUT/OUTPUT: Parallelograms
end note

